Personal baseline

Provide a simulated baseline-calibration process.

For example:

Collect several seconds of illustrative resting data.

Calculate a reference heart rate.

Calculate a reference GSR level.

Establish a motion baseline.

Mark the calibration as simulated.

Allow users to reset or repeat calibration.

